            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 27:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka dhano je ma cwire i winjo Cik meno nigi kwoŋ ayino i kwo pere, rupiri ndiko waco ni, “Ŋata ndir je kiwinji aka kitim gimoro je m'ondiki i kitawo ma Cik meno ŋato okwoŋ!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo adieri ni ongoye ŋata nwaŋo tiro ruwaŋ Were cungo kwoŋ Cik, rupiri ndiko waco ni, “Jom'otire jobino kwo cungo kwoŋ yeyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Cik kicungi kwoŋ yeyo; kucel waco ni, “Ŋata timo gimoro je ma cik waco bino kwo gine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
