        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.21.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 21:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Kristo olokere ŋat'okwoŋ ka waŋ wan, ogonyo wan woko kwoŋ ma Cik kelo, rupiri ndiko waco ni, “Nyatoro je m'olier wi yath meno ŋat'okwoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno, aka ŋey womiy Jopath silwany ma Were ociko Abraham i Yesu Kristo, aka wanyal jolo Cuny ma Were ociko cungo kwoŋ yeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik kodi cikirok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutmera, weyi akel ranen kwoŋ gima kisi ndelo: Ka j'ario joyere kwoŋ wac moro to jotimo cikirok i ndiko, ngoye ŋata nyalo turo cikirok no kosa medo kwoŋe gimoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I yo acel, Were otimo cikirok pere kodi Abraham gi nyakware. Ndiko kiwaci ni, “Gi nyikwaye.” Ma nyutho ni ji mathoth, to waco ni, “Gi nyakwarin.” Dwoŋ mere ni ŋat'acel, m'obedo Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 12:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwoŋ gim'awaco a me: Cik, m'obino rumacen ma oro miya aŋwen gi piero adek, kinyal turo cikirok to reyo woko gima Were ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 4:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ka lunjo lim bedo ro Cik m'otiek ketho meno nyutho ni gino k'owoki i cikirok moro. To Were i ŋono pere omiyo Abraham gima go wolunji rupiri oyido otimo gine cikirok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To onyo atoŋa pa Cik oyido obedo aŋo? Owodhi Cik ro tim pa ji mareco, aka omiti ni wobedi cuka bino pa nyakwar Abraham, m'otimi gine cikirok. Jomalaika jokonyo ikelo Cik no kareno dhano am'obedo jathek ma cungo i dier ji gi Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jathek tiyo i dier ji ma kalo acel; Were obedo ŋat'acel manitie i thenge acel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atoŋa ma Cik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
